    <briefdescription>
<para>A setup object containing callbacks to construct a memory manager and memory access object. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Both are optional. If not specified, <ref refid="classllvm_1_1orc_1_1_e_p_c_generic_j_i_t_link_memory_manager" kindref="compound">EPCGenericJITLinkMemoryManager</ref> and <ref refid="classllvm_1_1orc_1_1_e_p_c_generic_memory_access" kindref="compound">EPCGenericMemoryAccess</ref> will be used. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
